---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../config/site.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${siteConfig.siteName}`}
  description="Privacy Policy and GDPR compliance details for Calculadora IVA."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">
        Privacy <span class="gradient-text">Policy</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-[var(--text-tertiary)]">
        Last updated: January 2025 • GDPR Compliant
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-6 text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">1. Client-Side Processing (Zero Data Collection)</h2>
        <p>Your privacy is our core priority. All calculation amounts, rates, and formulas entered into Calculadora IVA are computed entirely within your web browser using client-side JavaScript. We do not store, log, transmit, or sell your financial figures to any external servers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">2. Local Storage</h2>
        <p>We use browser localStorage solely to remember your chosen visual theme (Light Mode vs. Dark Mode) across sessions. No personal identifiable information (PII) is stored.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">3. Contact Inquiries</h2>
        <p>If you submit a message via our Contact form, your name and email address are used exclusively to respond to your inquiry and are never shared with third parties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">4. Your Rights Under GDPR</h2>
        <p>Under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to access, rectify, or erase any personal information you have provided to us. For inquiries, contact <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`} class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold hover:underline">{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
